<p><font face="helvetica,arial" size="4" color="FF0300"><b>Soldiers Battle Field Gets a Face Lift</b></font></p>
<p align="justify"><font face="helvetica,arial" size="2" color="FE9700"><b><SCRIPT LANGUAGE='JavaScript'>
