You may have noticed that our website has recently been updated. The following features have been added or improved for your browsing pleasure...
<br><br>
<ul>
<li><A HREF="javascript:Chatbox()">Brand New Live Chatroom</a>
<li><a href="color_schemes.cfm">Color Scheme Picker</a>
<li><a href="index.cfm">User Login</a>, enables easier...
<ul>
<li><a href="raids.cfm">Raid Signups</a>
<li><a href="edit_char_check.cfm">Character Updates</a>
<li><A HREF="javascript:Chatbox()">Chat Room Login</a>
</ul>
</ul>

As well as a brand new design and layout, the site is much smarter and knows to automatically fill in fields when you are logged in. Try it!
<br><br>
Login (top right) and click on <a href="raids.cfm">Raids.</a> When you signup for a raid, your main character will already be filled in for you, with your current level already selected. (If you would like to bring an alternate character to the raid, simply type in his/her name and choose the appropriate level from the pulldown menu.) 
<br><br>
If you are unable to login, because you forgot your password, please <a href="mailto:fulblown@cris.com?subject=SoD - Forgot My Password">send email to Bobmd</a> with your issue (don't forget to include your character's name in the email.)
<br><br>
When the Tribunal Server goes down, come here and <A HREF="javascript:Chatbox()">CHAT LIVE</a> with your guild mates, until the server comes back up. Make secret date to chat with a loved one, have an affair on your wife, the chat room is very versitile.
<br><br>
What? You don't like these colors? <a href="color_schemes.cfm">Choose your own</a>, (must be logged in), there are 7 color schemes to choose from, one for each day of the week. You will never get bored with the SoD website again!
<br><br>
If that's not enough information for you, discuss your ideas with your guildies and check the most current news in the <a href="http://pub83.ezboard.com/bsoldiersofdestiny43227" target="_new">forums.</a> You can also log your epic progress, which is required if you want to receive help with your epic quest. A must see!
<br><br>
